  "details": "Not able to log in with my vrchat account, a new error message saying \"login failed-method not allowed\" shows up and stops the game, if you don't click anything (playing in desktop (not windows 10) ) you still get the normal loading and then a black screen but the music continues. it is like that each and every time. i tried re-installing, clearing the cache, verifying again and it still isn't working. i asked a lot of people from vrchat traders and people that do a lot of stuff in vrchat with models, i removed all of my models for this and it still is broken, so i don't think modelling is the fault for this (was just thinking this since i got an error in unity too) i have the new update that came out but still everything is broken.",
